 "description": "Per-Pok\u00e9mon breakdown for one set: how many card faces each species has and how they split across variants (base / Master Ball / Pok\u00e9 Ball / \u2026). \u4e2d\u6587\u7528\u6237: \u8fd9\u4e2a\u7cfb\u5217\u91cc\u6bcf\u53ea\u5b9d\u53ef\u68a6\u6709\u51e0\u5f20\u5361\u3001\u5404\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u7248\u672c(\u666e\u5361/\u5927\u5e08\u7403\u95ea/\u7cbe\u7075\u7403\u95ea)\u4e00\u8868\u62ff\u5168\u3002Answers \"which Pok\u00e9mon has the most versions in this set\". Counts are catalog facts, NOT pull-rate probabilities. Reads POKEKA market data only; server-side request logging is disclosed in the privacy policy; does not modify user data.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "lang": {
    "description": "Optional language track filter.",
    "enum": [
     "en",
     "ja",
     "zh-cn"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
